    "sections": {
        "description": "Bodyart Tattoo Studio is a clean and modern website theme designed for tattoo artists, tattoo studios, body art professionals, piercing studios, and creative portfolios. The theme focuses on visual presentation, allowing users to showcase tattoo designs, artist portfolios, galleries, services, pricing, and contact information in a clear and organized layout. Bodyart Tattoo Studio is suitable for individual tattoo artists, tattoo shops, body art studios, and creative designers who want to display their work online and manage appointments or client inquiries. The theme includes responsive design, gallery layouts, service sections, artist profiles, contact forms, and social media integration. It is built for easy customization, allowing users to change colors, fonts, images, and layout sections without technical knowledge. Bodyart Tattoo Studio is useful for small businesses, freelancers, and studios looking to create a professional online presence and showcase their artwork and services."
    },
